  "description": "FLC, carbon hard tails that are light and stiff. The FLC 29 Comp utilizes Haro's exclusive M2X frame design platform, an innovative approach that combines oversized tapered head tube, massive downtube, and wider bb92 bottom bracket delivering a high level of torsional stiffness to optimize power transfer and utilizes super stiff unidirectional high modulus carbon fiber. FLC 29 Comp features a RockShox Recon Gold RL 100mm travel fork with thru axle, semi complete Shimano SLX 1X drive train along side an FSA Comet Modular crankset with 32t chainring. Fast rolling 29\" performace thanks to its 29\" U-28 TL tubeless compatible disc rims and Kenda Honey Badger 60tpi tires. Also available in 27.5\" (see FLC 27.5 Comp)\nHaro FL Carbon Series, tapered head tube, BB92 shell, thru-axle\nNew RockShox Recon Gold RL taper fork, 100mm travel, thru-axle\nFSA Comet Modular crankset, 32T Crmo chainring\nShimano SLX 7000 Shadow Plus rear derailleur & shifter\nShimano SLX 7000 11-spd 11-46T cassette\nPivit alloy Light handlebar & stem\nRitchey MTN Trail Lock-On grips\nKenda Honey Badger XC 29\" x 2.2\" 60 tpi tires\nWeinmann U-28 TL Disc rims, Tubeless compatible\nShimano BR-395 / BL-396 disc brakeset",
